4.2. Baselines
4.2.1. Baselines for Synthetic dataset
We selected four models for comparison on synthetic datasets for comparison, including three state-of-the-art models: GCN [14], GAT with concatenation [17] and CurvGN [18]. GCN uses the node degree to explicitly compute
